~ jori_intro
[i]Every action has its consequences.[/i]
[i]For our crimes against humanity, we've been endlessly pursued.[/i]
[i]Some might say it's thrilling, but me? All I want is to live a quiet, normal life.[/i]
[i]So I was relieved to discover this sanctuary.
	A place the raiders couldn't follow us into.[/i]
[i]But among these glistening gold coins, I just can't shake the feeling...[/i]
[i]...That it was a mistake to step foot in here.[/i]
do! Methods.current_scene.show_jori("happy")
WELCOME!!! TO THE LAIR!!! OF THE GREAT. DRAGON. JORI!!!
PROTECTOR OF THE ETERNAL PYRE, DESTROYER OF HOMES, AND SELF-MADE BILLIONAIRE!!!
do! Methods.current_scene.jori_emo("smug")
Now, what do I owe the pleasure...
Of having an invader in my home?
Trespassing in my domain isn't a good look for you...
[i]Our worst fear have come true. The terrifying presence before us is Jori, the tyrranical ruler of the dungeon.[/i]
[i]As expected of a Great Dragon, she is known to be savage and ruthless.[/i]
[i]After wiping out the band of thieves that hid here, she ursurped their riches and rose to the throne.[/i]
[i]Oh dear. It's the end of us all. We're going to be her dinner.[/i]
- RUN
	do! Methods.current_scene.jori_emo("happy")
	Die.
	do! Methods.current_scene.date_death()
	=> END
- Camly dispatch the situation
	=> jori_intro_2
=> END

~ jori_intro_2
do! Methods.current_scene.jori_emo("neutral")
Shush. You are not to speak until I let you.
Usually, you would die by now, but I've thought of something better.
do! Methods.current_scene.jori_emo("annoyed")
Recently, the last of my servants unfortunately fell into the hands of the raiders.
Which is, honestly, like, such a huge pain! Who's going to do my shopping now?
So here's what gonna happen.
do! Methods.current_scene.jori_emo("happy")
You are going to be my new servants.
And you're going to get me 20 pieces of Flesh for lunch.
do! Methods.current_scene.jori_emo("smug")
Here is [color=gold]100 Moneys[/color]. Keep the change.
do! Methods.log_money()
[i]There is no change.[/i]
Now, off you go. And don't buy me any of those nasty Goat's Blood nonsense.
If you even try to run off with my cash, you won't see the end of me.
do! Methods.current_scene.exit_date()
=> END

~ jori_branch
if Global.sav.flesh >= 20:
	=> jori_pleased
elif Methods.check_money():
	=> jori_annoyed
else:
	=> bad_end

~ jori_pleased
do! Methods.current_scene.show_jori("happy")
Oh, my, gosh! Look who's good at following instructions!
That's 20 pieces of flesh, alright!
do! Methods.current_scene.jori_emo("smug")
What cute little servants. You deserve a reward.
do! Methods.current_scene.jori_emo("happy")
How about... some headpats?
- Yes
	do! Methods.current_scene.enter_headpat()
	[i]Jori's hand is soft and warm.[/i]
	[i]Though she is a cold-blooded reptile, being a fire dragon seems to still produce noticeable body heat.[/i]
	[i]I can feel genuine affection and appreciation through the way she caresses me, even if she's too proud to say it herself.[/i]
	do! Methods.current_scene.exit_headpat()
	[i]...Though it is nice, it is a bit weird. This should probably stop here.[/i]
- No, what?
	do! Methods.current_scene.play_grass_cracking_sound()
	...Oh.
	Okay, then. That's alright. Um...
	do! Methods.current_scene.continue_music()
do! Methods.current_scene.jori_emo("neutral")
Well, let's get to eating these before they start to rot.
[i]With utmost ease, she snaps a bonfire into existence.[/i]
do Methods.current_scene.jori_emo("smug")
...What are you doing just standing there? Come here. Let's eat together!
[i]Together...? With a Great Dragon like her...?[/i]
[i]If my knowledge serves right, self-centered and powerful beings like her want no association with the average dweller.[/i]
[i]Why has she taken such a special interest in us?[/i]
do Methods.current_scene.show_campfire("neutral")
Even though we're monsters, we should still practice good eating etiquette, okay?
Make sure to not spill it over your clothes- oh, right. You're all naked.
do Methods.current_scene.campfire_emo("sad_minor")
[i]My[/i] clothes? My late servant designed it for me. You like it?
do Methods.current_scene.campfire_emo("neutral")
It's like, really ahead of the times. Probably like a few centuries.
Yeah, I would just instinctually gulp things down like you, too, but I need to keep these clean.
It's all I have left of her.
[i]Reliable, caring, and considerate... Yet the legends speak horrors about her kind.[/i]
[i]Surely, it can't all be false?[/i]
do Methods.current_scene.campfire_emo("sad_minor")
...I'm sorry. I'm getting a bit sentimental.
It's a bit rude talking about my ex-servants in front of my current ones, but...
do Methods.current_scene.campfire_emo("neutral")
You'd understand, right?
do Methods.current_scene.campfire_emo("sad_minor")
This dungeon... our home... is going under. Soon. I can't help but feel sad.
do Methods.current_scene.campfire_emo("crying_away")
I'm supposed to be the strongest there is. Those who enter my servitude should at least be promised my protection.
But I couldn't even save them.
do Methods.current_scene.campfire_emo("crying_into")
They had to save me from [color=green]him[/color].
[i]Jori has so much love to give. But her primal anger is aching to be let out.[/i]
[i]Once her love gets polluted with enough misery, it's for certain that the world will know her wrath.[/i]
do Methods.current_scene.campfire_emo("crying_away")
...Hey, I shouldn't have sent you out before. It's dangerous outside.
Just stay with me from now on, okay?
When [color=green]he[/color] eventualy gets here... Just run. As fast as you can.
It is my duty to stay and [i]rip[/i] these savages apart.
- Don't be ridiculous. You'd die.
do Methods.current_scene.campfire_emo("crying_into")
...Huh?
- Don't just use us as a way...
...
- ...to allieviate the guilt in your heart.
...
- I deserve to have you in my life.
...
- Your late servants deserve meaningful deaths.
...
- And you deserve to be happy, too.
...
- So don't just put up with this.
...
- For our sake, and all of monsterkind's sake...
...
- Run with us. We can escape. Together.
...
do Methods.current_scene.campfire_emo("crying_away")
Alright.
do Methods.current_scene.show_flame()
[i]It's as if the very Sun is before your eyes.[/i]
[i]A flame that burns so bright, it makes the world flicker into darkness.[/i]
The Eternal Pyre. My Relic.
If we surrender this, [color=green]Hannes[/color] will only get stronger.
But we will live another day, to rally our forces.
And may he see the day the Great Dragons he hunts for sport [i]tear[/i] him apart piece by piece.
... Come, now.
Take my hand.
Let's fly away from this place.
- [color=red]DEVOUR[/color]
- [color=red]DEVOUR[/color]
do! Methods.current_scene.skip_text_at_end()
What are you doi
do! Methods.current_scene.devour_jori()
=> END

