do! Methods.current_scene.show_jori("annoyed")
Hey, I did tell you to get on with it, right?
Remember - it's 20 pieces of flesh.
do! Methods.current_scene.jori_emo("happy")
Now, chop chop! Get a move on!
do! Methods.current_scene.exit_date()
=> END

